      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "EGLAMOUR.\nAs many, worthy lady, to yourself.\nAccording to your ladyship’s impose,\nI am thus early come to know what service\nIt is your pleasure to command me in.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
